author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/ofwo13djO02zrZnS.jpeg", "width": 761, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "ULHAY7EKIptR~CVsoyofE1nPxtWBIoNHnikC", "full_resolution": [2228, 2208]}, "title": "A new horseman has joined the party", "last_comment_created": 1787480121162, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 0, "score_up": 27, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNSjoQj", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 35, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794329, "raw_content": "The US media, like Newsweek(1), misrepresent Trump at every turn. We know this. But sometimes your friends may bring up BS, and it helps to have facts to refute it. A friend recently told me, Trump's crazy he wants to replace modern advanced electric catapults and go back to steam.\n\nThe truth is Trump does want to do that and for good reason.\nSteam is way more reliable than electric, going over 4000 launches without a critical failure vs while the best electric has ever done is about 600 launches between failures. What's more, when electric fails it knocks out the all the launch racks in the system, while with steam each launch rack is separate. All the expertise needed to fix a steam system is on board, while electric requires bringing experts from the mainland. (2)\n\n(1) https://www.newsweek.com/steam-electromagnetic-catapult-comparison-aircraft-carriers-12321777 \n(2) https://www.eurasiantimes.com/why-trump-is-dumping-advanced-emals-for-1950s-steam-catapults-on-future-u-s-aircraft-carriers/", "author": "SuperDuperBasedMD", "created": 1787474726051, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Trump454748", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "More media BS: Trump on steam powered aircraft carriers", "last_comment_created": 1787482745681, "content": "<p>The US media, like Newsweek(1), misrepresent Trump at every turn. We know this. But sometimes your friends may bring up BS, and it helps to have facts to refute it. A friend recently told me, Trump's crazy he wants to replace modern advanced electric catapults and go back to steam.</p>\n<p>The truth is Trump does want to do that and for good reason.\nSteam is way more reliable than electric, going over 4000 launches without a critical failure vs while the best electric has ever done is about 600 launches between failures. What's more, when electric fails it knocks out the all the launch racks in the system, while with steam each launch rack is separate. All the expertise needed to fix a steam system is on board, while electric requires bringing experts from the mainland. (2)</p>\n<p>(1) <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/steam-electromagnetic-catapult-comparison-aircraft-carriers-12321777\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.newsweek.com/steam-electromagnetic-catapult-comparison-aircraft-carriers-12321777</a>\n(2) <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.eurasiantimes.com/why-trump-is-dumping-advanced-emals-for-1950s-steam-catapults-on-future-u-s-aircraft-carriers/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.eurasiantimes.com/why-trump-is-dumping-advanced-emals-for-1950s-steam-catapults-on-future-u-s-aircraft-carriers/</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, 